## Swift / SwiftPM
.build/
.swiftpm/
DerivedData/

# Package.resolved is intentionally COMMITTED (not ignored) so clones get
# deterministic dependency versions. We have no SPM deps today, but the moment
# we add one this file will start carrying weight.

## Xcode (generated when the user opens Package.swift in Xcode)
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

