## Icon design sources we don't track
# Pre-built duplicate of scripts/AppIcon.icns — the committed .icns is rebuilt
# deterministically from scripts/GifEditor.iconset/ by `iconutil`, so this one
# stays on disk for the designer's convenience but out of the repo.
scripts/GifEditor.icns
